1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,142
Ask an AI: how many R's are in strawberry?

2
00:00:03,392 --> 00:00:05,955
It slams the buzzer and screams: TWO!

3
00:00:06,105 --> 00:00:07,265
Completely wrong.

4
00:00:07,515 --> 00:00:09,250
Because 'berry' has two R's,

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,405
and it never bothered to spell it out.

6
00:00:11,655 --> 00:00:13,149
Enter the reasoning model:

7
00:00:13,299 --> 00:00:15,580
Generating secret thinking tokens.

8
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:18,410
One, two, three. Solved.
